    "description": "Strict user-supplied scope. Domains must be unique after normalization and include primary_domain; declare at most one handle per platform. Markets must be unique supported country codes. Observations must have unique target_id values that exactly match a declared domain:<domain>, social:<platform>:<handle>, or market:<ISO> target. No caller verification or provenance flags are accepted."
